<title>JAPAN: Japan Radio shares rise on earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Japan Radio shares rise on earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Radio Co Ltd shares rose in Monday morning trade as investors welcomed the recent upward revision in its earnings forecast, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0053 GMT, the shares were 30 yen higher at 1,530 yen.</p>
<p>On Friday, the telecommunications equipment maker forecast parent current profit of 8.30 billion yen for the year to March 31, 1997, up from an earlier forecast of 6.30 billion yen.</p>
</text>
